config AIC8800_CORE
	tristate "AIC8800D80 fullmac WiFi support"
	depends on CFG80211
	help
	  Experimental native fullmac driver for AICsemi AIC8800D80 devices.
	  Implements the firmware command ABI, station-mode cfg80211 operations,
	  firmware boot, and Ethernet/802.11 data conversion. Hardware validation
	  is still required before this should be enabled in production kernels.

config AIC8800_SDIO
